---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import wide from '../assets/placeholder/presenting-wide.jpg';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
import { club, numberWord, listAnd } from '../data/club';
import { loadMembers } from '../lib/members';
const m = await loadMembers();
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Program', path: 'program/' }];
const sym = club.symposium;
---
<Base
  path="program/"
  crumbs={crumbs}
  title="Program | Michigan Sustainable Investments"
  description="What members of Michigan Sustainable Investments (MSI) do: investing education, team projects, professional development, and a symposium with speakers."
>
  <PageHead title="The program" lead="MSI members learn how sustainable investments are sourced, valued and judged. The program has four parts." crumbs={crumbs} />
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <figure class="photo prose-wide" style="margin:0 0 56px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;max-height:560px">
        <Picture src={wide} alt="A presenter in a dark suit points to a slide while an audience looks on." formats={['avif', 'webp']} widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1800]} sizes="(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1296px" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="object-fit:cover;width:100%;max-height:560px" />
      </figure>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Investing education</h2>
        <p>Modules cover how investors evaluate a deal for financial return and for impact. Members work through the main instruments: public equities screened on environmental, social and governance factors; green bonds; venture capital for mission-driven companies; microfinance; and clean-energy project finance.</p>
        <h2>Hands-on projects</h2>
        <p>Members apply the material in team projects and present their work to the club.</p>
        <h2>Professional development</h2>
        <p>Sessions cover finance recruiting: building a résumé, networking and interviewing.</p>
        <h2>Speakers and the Symposium</h2>
        <p>{`MSI hosts practitioners on campus. Its flagship event, founded as the ${club.formerName}, ran ${numberWord(sym.count)} times between ${sym.firstYear} and ${sym.lastYear}. Speakers have come from ${listAnd(club.speakerFirms)}.`}</p>
        <h2 id="careers">Careers this prepares you for</h2>
        <p>Sustainable finance is now a line of business at banks, asset managers and funds. Members use MSI to prepare for roles in:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Investment banking.</strong> Energy transition, renewables, and power and utilities groups advise on and finance the build-out of clean power.</li>
          <li><strong>Sustainable finance and capital markets.</strong> Desks that structure green and sustainability-linked bonds.</li>
          <li><strong>Asset management and research.</strong> Funds and analysts that weigh environmental, social and governance factors in public markets.</li>
          <li><strong>Impact investing and venture capital.</strong> Funds that back companies with a measurable social or environmental goal.</li>
        </ul>
        {m.placements.length > 0 && <p><a class="arrow-link" href={url('placements/')}>See where members have gone →</a></p>}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
